WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

c002
00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:09.232
A grassy field with scattered trees stretches under a pink and blue sky.

c005
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.079
A grey bird sits on a branch, then flies away.

c006
00:00:30.134 --> 00:00:34.221
A tree with a hollow at its base stands alone in a grassy field.

c009
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.651
Grey rabbit stretches, yawns, steps from hollow.

c010
00:00:53.281 --> 00:00:58.808
In a moment, the rabbit rears on hind legs, stretches its forepaws up, and turns around.

c011
00:01:00.836 --> 00:01:04.644
In a moment, the rabbit walks to white flowers, leans down.

c012
00:01:06.487 --> 00:01:10.481
In a moment, a squirrel perched on a high branch watches the rabbit below.

c015
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.700
Then from the ground.

c016
00:01:28.997 --> 00:01:33.827
In a moment, the rabbit holds the red apple in its forepaws and eats it standing.

c017
00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:39.663
In a moment, a white rabbit stands in a field, holding a red apple.

c019
00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:52.637
The white rabbit stands in the field, holding a small brown object in its forepaws.

c020
00:01:54.598 --> 00:01:59.799
In a moment, the rabbit leaps up on its hind legs, reaching for a butterfly near a tree.
